{
  "name": "KPL SAB 赛制 / KPL SAB League Format",
  "author": "L-ku",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组、S/A/B 各 3 个单循环（45 场）、赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）+ 7-10 名排位赛、推送官方最终名次与对阵新闻、修正国际杯抽签里的挂名队和不重复席位。1.2.0 起每个赛段开始（春季赛开档、夏季赛 6/22 转会期开启）先随机抽签分成三组并推送抽签新闻；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起才显示「KPL S组/A组/B组」，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」。命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。1.1.0 起中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队和所有新生成的选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。建议与 KPL + Real LoL Teams 数据包一起使用。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: per-round standings reset and regrouping, three single round-robins per group (45 matches), a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff with 7-10 placement matches, official final-rank news, and international-cup seat fixes. As of 1.2.0 each split starts with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer-window opening for Summer) with a news push; round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\". Naming is display-only and never touches league ids, regions or standings. As of 1.1.0 every athlete in the CN region — including the second division, academy teams and newly generated players — gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing any stats. Best used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-18",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.0"
    }
  ]
}
